  "limitations": [
    "Complexity and branch targets are soft; mandatory bright, outline and connector members may exceed them.",
    "Novelty is bounded by quality. Topology and edge-diversity statistics can decline while clarity improves.",
    "Finite sampling cannot guarantee all sharp angles disappear or find every legal connected graph.",
    "Manual regions may be disconnected or contain holes; regional suggestions remain legal forests where needed. Automatic seed figures must be connected.",
    "Boundary certificate pertains to the retained draw-9 reference layout, not a new optimum for final draw-10 wiring.",
    "Only three root seeds were compared for full rounds. Existing boundary solver may take much longer on difficult seeds.",
    "Automatic figure diameter/common window retained; allowed maximum edge is now 56 degrees. Free manual edits keep their separate geometry contract.",
    "Historical reports are retained. Intermediate failed solver experiments and an earlier timeout log are not counted as passed checks.",
    "No perception study; formal V1/V2 star maps are not changed."
  ],
  "implementationNotes": {
